		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The next day, we saw another side of Kanas Lake at the Three Bays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery3.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery3_hu_14555f102df3b2c5.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery3_hu_9eee1f5954060f2a.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Cows strolling slowly on a wild path&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
