		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery32.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1080&#34;
	height=&#34;1919&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery32_hu_43c0bd8929976de8.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery32_hu_4af5637b6760c287.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Snow-capped mountains behind the Three Bays&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
