	width=&#34;1080&#34;
	height=&#34;1919&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery33_hu_ae1729e0a1264461.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery33_hu_ff84d63508a9476a.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;A spectacular view of the Three Bays, seemingly after a landslide&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;56&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;135px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery34.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery34_hu_9205c0a86d5ab113.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery34_hu_90310a55a68e3d48.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;The surface of the lake at the Three Bays&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery35.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery35_hu_66555501239a707.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery35_hu_f34627ff56dc4594.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Whirlpools in the Three Bays&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before heading to Kanas, we also visited Baihaba in the far northwest of China, and found the scenery across the border to be surprisingly pristine and magnificent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery4.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery4_hu_eefd26715ae1f8ae.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery4_hu_b25d80935f529327.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;The China-Kazakhstan border at Baihaba&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery41.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery41_hu_e542c453a4d53989.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery41_hu_f79ceac8b2ce5854.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Our three border passes&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We only slept in the tent for one night. We took advantage of the time before the cold snap hit to gaze at the long-lost starry sky, though unfortunately, our gear was too crappy to capture how breathtaking it was in person. Anyway, we fell asleep listening to the wind and rain that night, and woke up freezing the next morning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery5.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1080&#34;
	height=&#34;1440&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery5_hu_b970f3169105ab2b.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery5_hu_1f96d60b65030a06.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Shaoda and I setting up the tent with headlamps&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;75&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;180px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then the cold snap actually hit, so we had no choice but to retreat to a 300-RMB-a-night guesthouse—but I have to admit, it was super comfortable! That evening, we still cooked dinner in the kitchen like a camping meal and watched a badminton final (though I forgot which tournament it was).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery6.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1919&#34;
	height=&#34;1080&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery6_hu_c0af91645c557d27.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery6_hu_fa4457598eed9d34.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;A rainbow captured in the morning from the guesthouse&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The funniest part is that the three of us only did one thing across all the tourist spots in Kanas: we ate grilled sausages from every single vendor&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Of course, in Burqin, we also had the best &lt;em&gt;banmian&lt;/em&gt; (pulled noodles) we&amp;rsquo;ve eaten in Xinjiang in years!!! (An absolutely amazing spicy pepper &lt;em&gt;banmian&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;zhuafan&lt;/em&gt; pilaf)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During this little gap trip (since we had been stuck at school all summer), one person was terrified of getting mauled by a bear, another was walking around blowing vape clouds from his &amp;ldquo;character enhancer,&amp;rdquo; and someone else kept making plans only to watch them get completely derailed by reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery7.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1084&#34;
	height=&#34;1752&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery7_hu_1f1351fa5b06c65b.jpg 480w, https://DespairJasper.github.io/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery7_hu_7698e39b0a824837.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Our only group photo, taken by the carpool driver after we got back to school&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;61&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;148px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
